{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/openmpi","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:07.946Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azurelinux/base/openmpi/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azurelinux/base/openmpi/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis repository contains the official Open MPI image for Azure Linux.\n\n### What is Azure Linux?\n\nAzure Linux is a Linux distribution for Microsoft’s cloud infrastructure and edge products and services. Azure Linux is designed to provide a consistent platform for these devices and services and will enhance Microsoft’s ability to stay current on Linux updates.  \n\nTo learn more about Azure Linux, refer to our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n### What is Open MPI?\n\nOpen MPI is a Message Passing Interface (MPI) library project combining technologies and resources from several other projects (FT-MPI, LA-MPI, LAM/MPI, and PACX-MPI.\n\nSee: [Open MPI](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/openmpi)\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `4`\n\nThe featured tags are multi-architecture tags (i.e., `x86-64` and `aarch64`) that refer to the latest version of the image. Additional tags that are specific to Open MPI version, Azure Linux build, or architecture can be found in the Tags section.\n\n## Usage\n\nThe Open MPI image ships with a bash shell. The following command will launch the shell:\n\n    docker run -it --rm mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/openmpi:4\n\n    module load openmpi/gcc\n    mpicc --version\n    \n\n## Support\n\nAzure Linux container images are supported only for internal Microsoft use. For more information please see our [Support Statement](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/SUPPORT.md).\n\n## License\n\nThe Azure Linux distribution is provided under the [MIT license](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/LICENSE). Individual packages and components are governed by their own licenses included in the package sources available via srpm on [packages.microsoft.com](https://packages.microsoft.com/azurelinux/) or via our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-12T02:11:30.0129304+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"26K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"4.1","digest":"sha256:93ca3d1e27088a3b2c20cd8f0f5bb92a5807e2a119dda9f60588193a3bfb2267","pushed":"2026-09-12T01:46:36.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4","digest":"sha256:93ca3d1e27088a3b2c20cd8f0f5bb92a5807e2a119dda9f60588193a3bfb2267","pushed":"2026-09-12T01:46:34.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.1.9a1-3-azl3.0.20260909-arm64","digest":"sha256:8021f430289be2a0f7b2ea1d8fa3a73e7051ba30ed9a0019d1caaa884824af90","pushed":"2026-09-12T01:46:30.0000000+00:00","size":2682,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.1.9a1-3-azl3.0.20260909","digest":"sha256:93ca3d1e27088a3b2c20cd8f0f5bb92a5807e2a119dda9f60588193a3bfb2267","pushed":"2026-09-12T01:46:28.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"4.1.9a1-3-azl3.0.20260909-amd64","digest":"sha256:3f0569eaa8cb85dcdb5a208276be9918d2885e3a6823ef3fd2aaf9d94579a225","pushed":"2026-09-12T01:46:09.0000000+00:00","size":2682,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.